From: Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] ASoC: rsnd: SRC sync mode is not related to clock master mode
Date: Mon, 7 Mar 2016 05:06:46 +0000
Message-ID: <87io0yyj74.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87lh5uyj9a.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
